    {
      "id": "src/Ctap2/CLAUDE.md#f2",
      "path": "src/Ctap2/CLAUDE.md",
      "kind": "fence",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "language": "csharp",
      "heading": "### Session Creation",
      "opening_line": 128,
      "closing_line": 131,
      "extracted_text": "// With IYubiKey yubiKey in an async method; this factory owns the opened connection.\nawait using var session = await yubiKey.CreateCtap2SessionAsync();\n",
      "extracted_sha256": "8c95463d5f36e750f67caf697013bcf6e68c4e0b1c5199822bbf7fe134b1f612",
      "verbatim_text": "```csharp\n// With IYubiKey yubiKey in an async method; this factory owns the opened connection.\nawait using var session = await yubiKey.CreateCtap2SessionAsync();\n```\n",
      "document_sha256": "0bfe308f3dcaf2307bc2e3d463f174bd4a341a85b583c1ac2cb07d0ad65c2dcf",
      "origin_root": "/home/rupicola/Code/y/Yubico.Yubikit.NET",
      "classification": "compile",
      "reason": "Whole useful task/cleanup/assertions or typed fragment; see exact group prerequisites and edit-A\u2013F provenance.",
      "verbatim_sha256": "7a6b38d16cb7a7d9262241c8abb1a55a0a557f887f27e484979cbb550c36a465",
      "groups": [
        "guide-session"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "src/Ctap2/CLAUDE.md#f3",
      "path": "src/Ctap2/CLAUDE.md",
      "kind": "fence",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "language": "csharp",
      "heading": "### GetInfo (No User Presence Required)",
      "opening_line": 141,
      "closing_line": 153,
      "extracted_text": "// Get authenticator capabilities\nvar info = await session.GetInfoAsync();\n\n// Check versions\nbool ctap2_1 = info.Versions.Contains(\"FIDO_2_1\");\n\n// Check supported extensions\nbool hasHmacSecret = info.Extensions.Contains(\"hmac-secret\");\n\n// Check options\nbool hasRk = info.Options.TryGetValue(\"rk\", out var rk) && rk;\n",
      "extracted_sha256": "0d0459ed6006f488a0d499cefd113c23ca485a4c5bf14fb4725d7d54c9275ceb",
      "verbatim_text": "```csharp\n// Get authenticator capabilities\nvar info = await session.GetInfoAsync();\n\n// Check versions\nbool ctap2_1 = info.Versions.Contains(\"FIDO_2_1\");\n\n// Check supported extensions\nbool hasHmacSecret = info.Extensions.Contains(\"hmac-secret\");\n\n// Check options\nbool hasRk = info.Options.TryGetValue(\"rk\", out var rk) && rk;\n```\n",
      "document_sha256": "0bfe308f3dcaf2307bc2e3d463f174bd4a341a85b583c1ac2cb07d0ad65c2dcf",
      "origin_root": "/home/rupicola/Code/y/Yubico.Yubikit.NET",
      "classification": "compile",
      "reason": "Whole useful task/cleanup/assertions or typed fragment; see exact group prerequisites and edit-A\u2013F provenance.",
      "verbatim_sha256": "253da6ff1b7394ddc4a61bad9cd64684c5b71c3cb8a8a96fdcee88aebd053fa1",
      "groups": [
        "guide-info"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "src/Ctap2/CLAUDE.md#f4",
      "path": "src/Ctap2/CLAUDE.md",
      "kind": "fence",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "language": "csharp",
      "heading": "### PIN/UV Auth Protocols",
      "opening_line": 167,
      "closing_line": 198,
      "extracted_text": "// Fragment: session, byte[] pin, string rpId, byte[32] clientDataHash,\n// MakeCredentialOptions options, RP/user entities and CancellationToken cancellationToken are supplied.\n// Requires mutually supported protocol 2; this constructor does not negotiate it.\nusing var protocol = new PinUvAuthProtocolV2();\nusing var clientPin = new ClientPin(session, protocol);\n\n// Get PIN token with permissions. rpId is required for MakeCredential/GetAssertion permissions.\nbyte[]? pinToken = null;\nbyte[]? authParam = null;\ntry\n{\n    pinToken = await clientPin.GetPinUvAuthTokenUsingPinAsync(\n        pin,\n        PinUvAuthTokenPermissions.MakeCredential,\n        rpId,\n        cancellationToken);\n\n    // Authenticate command\n    authParam = protocol.Authenticate(pinToken, clientDataHash);\n    options.WithPinUvAuth(authParam, protocol.Version);\n    // Keep options.UserVerification null; even uv:false is mutually exclusive with token auth.\n    await session.MakeCredentialAsync(\n        clientDataHash, rp, user, [PublicKeyCredentialParameters.CreateES256()], options,\n        cancellationToken);\n}\nfinally\n{\n    if (pinToken is not null) CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(pinToken);\n    if (authParam is not null) CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(authParam);\n}\n",
      "extracted_sha256": "fd7927c770fbcb26910b39d13c59536ff0e76a7931436b3a49e851eed6ee37f7",
      "verbatim_text": "```csharp\n// Fragment: session, byte[] pin, string rpId, byte[32] clientDataHash,\n// MakeCredentialOptions options, RP/user entities and CancellationToken cancellationToken are supplied.\n// Requires mutually supported protocol 2; this constructor does not negotiate it.\nusing var protocol = new PinUvAuthProtocolV2();\nusing var clientPin = new ClientPin(session, protocol);\n\n// Get PIN token with permissions. rpId is required for MakeCredential/GetAssertion permissions.\nbyte[]? pinToken = null;\nbyte[]? authParam = null;\ntry\n{\n    pinToken = await clientPin.GetPinUvAuthTokenUsingPinAsync(\n        pin,\n        PinUvAuthTokenPermissions.MakeCredential,\n        rpId,\n        cancellationToken);\n\n    // Authenticate command\n    authParam = protocol.Authenticate(pinToken, clientDataHash);\n    options.WithPinUvAuth(authParam, protocol.Version);\n    // Keep options.UserVerification null; even uv:false is mutually exclusive with token auth.\n    await session.MakeCredentialAsync(\n        clientDataHash, rp, user, [PublicKeyCredentialParameters.CreateES256()], options,\n        cancellationToken);\n}\nfinally\n{\n    if (pinToken is not null) CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(pinToken);\n    if (authParam is not null) CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(authParam);\n}\n```\n",
      "document_sha256": "0bfe308f3dcaf2307bc2e3d463f174bd4a341a85b583c1ac2cb07d0ad65c2dcf",
      "origin_root": "/home/rupicola/Code/y/Yubico.Yubikit.NET",
      "classification": "compile",
      "reason": "Whole useful task/cleanup/assertions or typed fragment; see exact group prerequisites and edit-A\u2013F provenance.",
      "verbatim_sha256": "50346c9df6828f06e6086785a6723a0844887122b3c3324fe15f9486b1c7a9dd",
      "groups": [
        "guide-pin-create"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "src/Ctap2/CLAUDE.md#f5",
      "path": "src/Ctap2/CLAUDE.md",
      "kind": "fence",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "language": "csharp",
      "heading": "#### Example Usage",
      "opening_line": 247,
      "closing_line": 266,
      "extracted_text": "// Builder fragment: ReadOnlyMemory<byte> blobData and the hmac-secret inputs below are caller-supplied.\n// Build extensions for MakeCredential\nvar extensions = new ExtensionBuilder()\n    .WithCredProtect(CredProtectPolicy.UserVerificationRequired)\n    .WithCredBlob(blobData)\n    .Build();\n\nvar options = new MakeCredentialOptions\n{\n    Extensions = extensions,\n    ResidentKey = true\n};\n\n// For GetAssertion: encrypted salts under the shared secret from key agreement\n// protocol/sharedSecret/keyAgreement and 32-byte salt1/salt2 belong to the caller.\nvar assertionExtensions = new ExtensionBuilder()\n    .WithHmacSecret(protocol, sharedSecret, keyAgreement, salt1, salt2)\n    .Build();\n",
      "extracted_sha256": "1e9b6ac91a7db4e9b4bdd6cd0b01550da1ddfe583020d7e683c0f118ccbd002a",
      "verbatim_text": "```csharp\n// Builder fragment: ReadOnlyMemory<byte> blobData and the hmac-secret inputs below are caller-supplied.\n// Build extensions for MakeCredential\nvar extensions = new ExtensionBuilder()\n    .WithCredProtect(CredProtectPolicy.UserVerificationRequired)\n    .WithCredBlob(blobData)\n    .Build();\n\nvar options = new MakeCredentialOptions\n{\n    Extensions = extensions,\n    ResidentKey = true\n};\n\n// For GetAssertion: encrypted salts under the shared secret from key agreement\n// protocol/sharedSecret/keyAgreement and 32-byte salt1/salt2 belong to the caller.\nvar assertionExtensions = new ExtensionBuilder()\n    .WithHmacSecret(protocol, sharedSecret, keyAgreement, salt1, salt2)\n    .Build();\n```\n",
      "document_sha256": "0bfe308f3dcaf2307bc2e3d463f174bd4a341a85b583c1ac2cb07d0ad65c2dcf",
      "origin_root": "/home/rupicola/Code/y/Yubico.Yubikit.NET",
      "classification": "compile",
