      "opening_line": 407,
      "closing_line": 419,
      "extracted_text": "// With byte[] pinBytes supplied by the caller, in a synchronous method.\nSpan<byte> pinHash = stackalloc byte[32];\ntry\n{\n    SHA256.HashData(pinBytes, pinHash);\n}\nfinally\n{\n    CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(pinHash);\n    CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(pinBytes);\n}\n",
      "extracted_sha256": "e761731dfe7dcb344ce4f1204f44bcb0d8f518a4e9bd6f56c9dbbef48219a9c8",
      "verbatim_text": "```csharp\n// With byte[] pinBytes supplied by the caller, in a synchronous method.\nSpan<byte> pinHash = stackalloc byte[32];\ntry\n{\n    SHA256.HashData(pinBytes, pinHash);\n}\nfinally\n{\n    CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(pinHash);\n    CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(pinBytes);\n}\n```\n",
