    {
      "id": "src/Ctap2/tests/CLAUDE.md#f2",
      "path": "src/Ctap2/tests/CLAUDE.md",
      "kind": "fence",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "language": "csharp",
      "heading": "### PIN Management in Tests",
      "opening_line": 104,
      "closing_line": 117,
      "extracted_text": "// With an existing ICtap2Session session; only on a human-approved test device.\nusing var protocol = new PinUvAuthProtocolV2();\nusing var clientPin = new ClientPin(session, protocol);\nbyte[] pin = Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(Ctap2TestStateExtensions.KnownTestPinString);\ntry\n{\n    await clientPin.SetPinAsync(pin);\n}\nfinally\n{\n    CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(pin);\n}\n",
      "extracted_sha256": "4cea636cf382a900dd1df31a3ec8d8634e024080f81dfedaab03a95615a87593",
      "verbatim_text": "```csharp\n// With an existing ICtap2Session session; only on a human-approved test device.\nusing var protocol = new PinUvAuthProtocolV2();\nusing var clientPin = new ClientPin(session, protocol);\nbyte[] pin = Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(Ctap2TestStateExtensions.KnownTestPinString);\ntry\n{\n    await clientPin.SetPinAsync(pin);\n}\nfinally\n{\n    CryptographicOperations.ZeroMemory(pin);\n}\n```\n",
