      "opening_line": 47,
      "closing_line": 76,
      "extracted_text": "flowchart TD\n    Core[\"Yubico.YubiKit.Core<br/><i>the hub \u2014 everything depends on it</i>\"]\n\n    Mgmt[\"Management\"]\n    Piv[\"Piv\"]\n    Oath[\"Oath\"]\n    OpenPgp[\"OpenPgp\"]\n    SD[\"SecurityDomain\"]\n    Hsm[\"YubiHsm\"]\n    Otp[\"YubiOtp\"]\n    Ctap2[\"Ctap2\"]\n    WebAuthn[\"WebAuthn\"]\n\n    Mgmt --> Core\n    Piv --> Core\n    Oath --> Core\n    OpenPgp --> Core\n    SD --> Core\n    Hsm --> Core\n    Otp --> Core\n    Ctap2 --> Core\n    WebAuthn -->|\"one-way<br/>(Ctap2 has no ref back)\"| Ctap2\n    Ctap2 --> Core\n\n    classDef hub fill:#1f6feb,color:#fff,stroke:#0b3d91,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef second fill:#8957e5,color:#fff,stroke:#4c2889;\n    class Core hub;\n    class WebAuthn second;\n",
