      "extracted_text": "// Partial parser fixture (backend status already stripped), not a conforming GetInfo response.\n// Required AAGUID is absent; current decoder accepts this incomplete envelope.\nvar writer = new CborWriter(CborConformanceMode.Ctap2Canonical);\nwriter.WriteStartMap(1);\nwriter.WriteInt32(1);\nwriter.WriteStartArray(1);\nwriter.WriteTextString(\"FIDO_2_0\");\nwriter.WriteEndArray();\nwriter.WriteEndMap();\nbyte[] mockResponse = writer.Encode();\n",
